        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>12\" Pull x 24\" Towel Bar Set for Glass Doors</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nSet of 12 inch square pull combined with a 24 inch horizontal bar for glass door mounting. The 24\" horizontal bar can be used as a towel bar or just a pull handle. Easy to grip 1\" square handles. Available in Matte Black, Brushed Nickel or Polished Chrome finish. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nNon-Handed, reversible for left or right hand doors. Either length pull can be place on either side of your glass door. Includes all the hardware to mount one pull on each side of a Glass Door.\r\n</p> \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<!-- <p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-SSP1210-specifications.gif?v=1704354504\" width=\"549\" height=\"191\" border=\"0\" align=\"center\" atl=\"Deltana SSP1210 Specifications\">\r\n</p> -->\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the 12 x 24 Glass Door Pull Handle Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: 316 Marine Grade Stainless Steel Tubing</li>\r\n<li>Total Pull Length: 13\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Horizontal  Pull Length: 25\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Both Handle Diameter: 1\" square</li>\r\n<li>Both Handle Projection: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Both Handle Clearance: 1-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1/4\" to 1/2\" Thick Glass</li>\r\n<li>Hole in Glass Diameter: 7/16\" (11mm) - 10mm Minimum</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/SD-SQPP12X24.pdf?v=1704262411\"><b>SD-SQPP12X24 Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold as a set (12\" CTC x 24\" CTC) handles for Glass Door</i>\r\n</p>",
